#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "**If you contribute to quarkus.io:** local authoring is now a single `./mvnw quarkus:dev` call instead of a multi-hour journey debugging Ruby configuration. Live reload feels way faster, and the site’s tests run 42% faster than they did against the old site, so PR feedback arrives sooner.\n"
msgstr "**如果您为 quarkus.io 贡献代码：** 本地开发现在只需执行一次 `./mvnw quarkus:dev` 命令，而不必再花费数小时调试 Ruby 配置。 实时刷新速度明显提升，且网站测试运行速度比旧版网站快了 42%，因此 PR 反馈能更快地送达。\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/posts/2026/2026-09-21-jekyll-to-roq.md:64
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "**If you want the site to do more:** we’ve unlocked our wishlist of site features, because we can now code them up in Java.\n"
msgstr "**如果您希望网站能提供更多功能：**我们已经解锁了网站功能愿望清单，因为现在我们可以使用Java来编写这些功能了。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/posts/2026/2026-09-21-jekyll-to-roq.md:68
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As a bonus of scripting the conversion process, we now have a converter everyone can use on their own sites. \n"
"It’s still being refined, and isn’t fully documented in the Roq docs yet, but you can have a play with the [`roq-it-jekyll`](https://github.com/quarkiverse/quarkus-roq/blob/main/migration/roq-it-jekyll) script.\n"
msgstr ""
"通过编写转换过程的脚本，我们还额外获得了一个转换器，现在大家都可以将其用于自己的网站上。\n"
"该转换器仍在不断完善中，Roq 文档中尚未对其进行完整说明，但您可以尝试使用 [`roq-it-jekyll`](https://github.com/quarkiverse/quarkus-roq/blob/main/migration/roq-it-jekyll) 脚本进行尝试。\n"

